<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal direct insurance premiums slip Jan-June.</title>
<headline>Portugal direct insurance premiums slip Jan-June.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The accumulated volume of Portuguese insurers' direct premiums was down slightly between January and June compared to the previous year at 379.04 billion escudos, according to the Portuguese Insurers Association (APS).</p>
<p>The breakdown was as follows, in billions of escudos:</p>
<p>				     DIRECT INSURANCE PREMIUMS</p>
<p>				 Jan-June 97     Jan-June 96  Pct change</p>
<p>    Life			  146.91	   156.84	 -6.3</p>
<p>    Accident/illness	   65.05	    61.50	  5.8</p>
<p>    Fire/material damage     35.29	    33.39	  5.7</p>
<p>    Vehicle insurance	 119.73	   118.40	  1.1</p>
<p>	   TOTAL NON-LIFE     232.13	   224.95	  3.2</p>
<p>	   TOTAL GENERAL	379.04	   381.79	 -0.7</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
